[03:19.92]My darling, I know it all too well
[03:22.38]('Cause we're all pretending to be ourselves)
[03:24.01]So maybe you're real, maybe fake
[03:26.32]But your life is always your own to make
[03:28.46]So let's enjoy it
[03:31.72]For its own sake
[03:52.61]It's artifice exalted, a foxtrot fantasy
[03:56.69]You see? Don't you worry about a thing
[03:59.91]And we may part in the end
[04:05.68](But you can always come back around again)
